1
00:00:09,342 --> 00:00:10,510
<font color="white"><i>What's that?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:10,593 --> 00:00:12,095
<font color="white"><i>You have sharp ears?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:12,178 --> 00:00:15,974
<font color="white"><i>Good hearing has nothing to do with this</i></font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:16,057 --> 00:00:18,518
<font color="white"><i>This is all about the tremors</i></font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:18,601 --> 00:00:21,229
<font color="white"><i>Your whole body</i></font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:21,312 --> 00:00:25,734
<font color="white"><i>Feels it on its own</i></font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:26,651 --> 00:00:29,863
<font color="white"><i>Why, isn't that the green young master</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Chasing after his lady cousin?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:31,156 --> 00:00:32,824
<font color="white">I misjudged you.</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:00:33,408 --> 00:00:36,244
<font color="white">I had no idea you were so well-endowed.</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:00:36,327 --> 00:00:39,122
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Come now, you know nothing</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>-</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">Enough of your chatter.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

11
00:00:39,205 --> 00:00:41,332
<font color="white"><i>Let me teach you a thing or two</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Hear me well</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:00:41,416 --> 00:00:45,879
<font color="white"><i>Long and large is not all there is to it</i></font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:00:45,962 --> 00:00:50,467
<font color="white"><i>A pickaxe is too much for gathering clams</i></font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:54,804
<font color="white"><i>Throw a bucket into a spring</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Blow upon it softly</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:00:54,888 --> 00:00:57,348
<font color="white"><i>Press your lips to it</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Sip, sip, sip</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:00:57,432 --> 00:01:00,351
<font color="white"><i>Now why tease us so, Director?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:01:04,147 --> 00:01:05,482
<font color="white"><i>So it's a watermill, is it?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:01:05,982 --> 00:01:08,068
<font color="white"><i>Splash, trickle-trickle</i></font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:01:08,151 --> 00:01:10,153
<font color="white"><i>Creak-creak</i></font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:01:10,236 --> 00:01:15,450
<font color="white"><i>Pounding away nicely, I see</i></font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:01:15,533 --> 00:01:17,494
<font color="white"><i>"A flower must be held gently."</i></font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:01:17,994 --> 00:01:20,205
<font color="white"><i>"Grip it too hard and it shall break."</i></font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:01:20,830 --> 00:01:21,831
<font color="white"><i>At this rate,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:01:22,832 --> 00:01:25,126
<font color="white"><i>how is the iron ever to grow hot?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:01:25,210 --> 00:01:27,087
<font color="white"><i>Trying to plow a parched field, are we?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:01:29,172 --> 00:01:32,008
<font color="white"><i>"Young master, care to see for yourself?"</i></font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:01:32,091 --> 00:01:33,009
<font color="white"><i>All right!</i></font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:01:34,219 --> 00:01:37,013
<font color="white"><i>In he goes</i></font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:01:37,096 --> 00:01:39,974
<font color="white"><i>In he goes to see for himself</i></font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:01:40,058 --> 00:01:44,437
<font color="white"><i>The proud pestle springs upright</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Rises and falls, creaking all the while</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:01:44,521 --> 00:01:47,857
<font color="white"><i>In he goes to see for himself</i></font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:01:47,941 --> 00:01:51,569
<font color="white"><i>Splash, trickle-trickle, creak-creak</i></font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:01:51,653 --> 00:01:55,156
<font color="white"><i>Pounding away nicely, I see</i></font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:57,325
<font color="white"><i>The green lad is nowhere to be found now</i></font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:01:57,408 --> 00:01:59,869
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>No matter the hour</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Not here…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

36
00:01:59,953 --> 00:02:02,122
<font color="white"><i>No matter the place</i></font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:02:02,205 --> 00:02:05,834
<font color="white"><i>Even in the palanquin</i></font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:02:05,917 --> 00:02:09,546
<font color="white"><i>As it sways and bounces</i></font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:02:10,130 --> 00:02:13,675
<font color="white"><i>In he goes to see for himself</i></font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:02:14,342 --> 00:02:17,595
<font color="white"><i>"My lord, how many women have you held?"</i></font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:02:19,055 --> 00:02:20,306
<font color="white">Who counts grapes…</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:02:22,475 --> 00:02:24,227
<font color="white">as he eats them?</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:02:24,310 --> 00:02:27,438
<font color="white"><i>Now that's a fine answer</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>To a foolish question</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:02:27,522 --> 00:02:29,649
<font color="white"><i>"I had heard the rumors,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:02:30,275 --> 00:02:33,027
<font color="white"><i>but are you really such a lecherous man?"</i></font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:02:33,570 --> 00:02:34,696
<font color="white">And what do the rumors</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:02:36,364 --> 00:02:37,407
<font color="white">say of me?</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:02:38,908 --> 00:02:41,494
<font color="white"><i>Come now, need you ask?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:02:43,997 --> 00:02:46,541
<font color="white"><i>"They call you</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>the Gentleman of the Night."</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:02:46,624 --> 00:02:47,500
<font color="white"><i>How fitting</i></font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:02:48,668 --> 00:02:50,295
<font color="white">"The Gentleman of the Night"?</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:02:50,378 --> 00:02:52,547
<font color="white"><i>Indeed, he's a true gentleman</i></font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:02:52,630 --> 00:02:54,883
<font color="white"><i>Strictly for adults</i></font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:02:55,758 --> 00:02:57,218
<font color="white">A true gentleman…</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:02:59,929 --> 00:03:01,806
<font color="white">takes pleasure</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:03:02,932 --> 00:03:06,102
<font color="white">in enlightening worthy minds.</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:03:06,728 --> 00:03:07,937
<font color="white">Tonight…</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:03:10,106 --> 00:03:13,109
<font color="white">I shall teach you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and delight in a gentleman's pleasure.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

59
00:03:13,192 --> 00:03:14,027
<font color="white"><i>There we go</i></font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:03:18,948 --> 00:03:20,074
<font color="white">Here are…</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,912
<font color="white">the teachings of Xunzi.</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:03:28,958 --> 00:03:33,463
<font color="white"><i>Adrift and floating, softly afloat</i></font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:03:34,130 --> 00:03:38,927
<font color="white"><i>It feels as though walking upon the clouds</i></font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:03:39,010 --> 00:03:42,639
<font color="white"><i>Then crashing down to earth</i></font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:03:42,722 --> 00:03:46,309
<font color="white"><i>Ah, was it but a dream?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:03:46,809 --> 00:03:50,480
<font color="white"><i>Ah</i></font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:03:52,357 --> 00:03:57,820
<font color="white"><i>Have you awakened from the dream?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:03:58,571 --> 00:04:02,784
<font color="white"><i>It vanishes like foam</i></font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:04:02,867 --> 00:04:06,996
<font color="white"><i>Elusive as a shadow</i></font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:10,458
<font color="white"><i>After all that chasing and circling</i></font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:04:11,793 --> 00:04:15,421
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>You only find yourself</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yun!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

72
00:04:15,505 --> 00:04:19,926
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Where you began</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yun!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

73
00:04:20,009 --> 00:04:22,929
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Love</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yun!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

74
00:04:23,805 --> 00:04:26,891
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Love</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yun!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

75
00:04:26,975 --> 00:04:31,562
<font color="white"><i>What is this thing called love</i></font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:04:31,646 --> 00:04:36,025
<font color="white"><i>That it lives in dreams</i></font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:04:36,109 --> 00:04:38,695
<font color="white"><i>And it lives on</i></font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:43,408
<font color="white"><i>Upon waking</i></font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:04:43,491 --> 00:04:46,744
<font color="white"><i>Why does it cling to you</i></font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:04:47,745 --> 00:04:52,417
<font color="white"><i>So cruelly to the bitter end?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:04:52,917 --> 00:04:56,671
<font color="white"><i>Love</i></font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:04:57,171 --> 00:05:02,051
<font color="white"><i>Love</i></font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:05:05,179 --> 00:05:12,145
<font color="white"><i>My love</i></font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:05:12,228 --> 00:05:18,234
<font color="white">THE SCANDAL</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:05:31,873 --> 00:05:34,000
<font color="white">As the Left State Councilor</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">must have told you,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

86
00:05:34,083 --> 00:05:35,168
<font color="white">I shall be</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:05:36,336 --> 00:05:37,879
<font color="white">staying in this household for a time.</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:05:38,921 --> 00:05:42,967
<font color="white">But whatever the reason,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">perhaps this too is fate.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

89
00:05:45,011 --> 00:05:47,096
<font color="white">Tell him I have heard enough, Eun-sil.</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:05:48,306 --> 00:05:50,600
<font color="white">-My lady says--</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-I could not properly see you home,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

91
00:05:51,976 --> 00:05:53,352
<font color="white">and it has weighed on me.</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:06:00,443 --> 00:06:03,863
<font color="white">I merely wished to know</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">whether you returned safely.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

93
00:06:04,489 --> 00:06:06,949
<font color="white">If you would turn your face from me so,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">what am I to do?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

94
00:06:09,118 --> 00:06:11,287
<font color="white">Have I perhaps caused</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">some misunderstanding?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

95
00:06:14,540 --> 00:06:16,167
<font color="white">Tell him there is no misunderstanding.</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:06:17,543 --> 00:06:20,046
<font color="white">My lady says there is no misunderstanding…</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:06:24,592 --> 00:06:26,177
<font color="white">The day I first met you,</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:06:26,260 --> 00:06:28,596
<font color="white">I found this where you had been standing.</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:37,730
<font color="white">I shall accept your thanks</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in the form of a letter,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

100
00:06:39,273 --> 00:06:42,527
<font color="white">for there are</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">too many eyes and ears about.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

101
00:06:42,610 --> 00:06:44,946
<font color="white">My husband</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">could not stop praising your cousin,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

102
00:06:45,571 --> 00:06:47,365
<font color="white">and he is not a man of many words.</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:06:47,448 --> 00:06:49,117
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:06:49,784 --> 00:06:50,910
<font color="white">Her Ladyship approaches!</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:06:52,703 --> 00:06:54,163
<font color="white">For heaven's sake!</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:06:54,664 --> 00:06:56,582
<font color="white">Please do not do this, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:06:57,083 --> 00:06:58,209
<font color="white">Give it to me, I beg you.</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:06:58,793 --> 00:06:59,836
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:07:00,336 --> 00:07:01,838
<font color="white">They have been discussing literature…</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:07:01,921 --> 00:07:02,922
<font color="white">All right.</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:07:06,008 --> 00:07:07,802
<font color="white">Your Ladyship.</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:07:07,885 --> 00:07:10,471
<font color="white">Lady So, good to see you.</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:07:13,057 --> 00:07:17,395
<font color="white">I spotted you from afar</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and was so delighted I nearly ran over.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

114
00:07:18,938 --> 00:07:20,440
<font color="white">Shall we?</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:07:22,942 --> 00:07:25,027
<font color="white">I am most excited</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">about today's poetry gathering.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

116
00:07:25,111 --> 00:07:26,487
<font color="white">If that proves too difficult,</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:07:27,488 --> 00:07:29,115
<font color="white">then I shall write to you first.</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:07:42,253 --> 00:07:43,463
<font color="white">Surely you will answer me?</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:07:47,008 --> 00:07:48,426
<font color="white">Fine, I will.</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:07:48,509 --> 00:07:49,969
<font color="white">Now, please.</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:07:58,769 --> 00:07:59,854
<font color="white">Oh, here.</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:08:06,903 --> 00:08:08,196
<font color="white">Are you all right?</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:08:09,197 --> 00:08:11,324
<font color="white">I saw you here</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">on my way to the rear garden</font><font color="white"></font></font>

124
00:08:11,407 --> 00:08:13,576
<font color="white">with the Lady of the First Rank.</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:08:15,578 --> 00:08:16,704
<font color="white">Do not worry.</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:08:17,622 --> 00:08:19,749
<font color="white">She did not see anything.</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:08:25,963 --> 00:08:28,257
<font color="white">You can tell me anything and everything.</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:08:28,883 --> 00:08:31,469
<font color="white">Forgive me. The truth is…</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:08:45,566 --> 00:08:47,109
<font color="white">Regarding what happened the other day,</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:50,655
<font color="white">I ought to have come to you sooner</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and offered my thanks.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

131
00:08:52,448 --> 00:08:53,574
<font color="white">Yet I was delayed.</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:09:25,898 --> 00:09:28,359
<font color="white">One can feel a mother's heart in it.</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:09:29,193 --> 00:09:33,573
<font color="white">Now, allow me to recite a poem I wrote.</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:09:36,367 --> 00:09:38,452
<font color="white"><i>Though the full moon has waned</i></font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:09:38,536 --> 00:09:40,705
<font color="white"><i>My beloved is still yet to return</i></font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:09:40,788 --> 00:09:43,124
<font color="white"><i>The endless clatter of the loom</i></font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:09:43,207 --> 00:09:45,459
<font color="white"><i>Fills this lonely heart</i></font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:10:03,769 --> 00:10:04,604
<font color="white">Were you</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:10:05,688 --> 00:10:07,231
<font color="white">intending to help me again this time?</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:10:08,024 --> 00:10:09,025
<font color="white">Because you were lonely?</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:10:10,318 --> 00:10:11,485
<font color="white">How fares it?</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:10:11,569 --> 00:10:13,195
<font color="white">It is going so easily</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:10:14,739 --> 00:10:16,240
<font color="white">I almost feel bad for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:10:17,408 --> 00:10:18,784
<font color="white">You sound fairly confident.</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:10:19,410 --> 00:10:21,996
<font color="white">Then when you feel</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the task is almost complete,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

146
00:10:22,496 --> 00:10:24,498
<font color="white">would you come see me for a moment?</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:10:24,582 --> 00:10:25,416
<font color="white">Why?</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:10:26,292 --> 00:10:27,501
<font color="white">Do you mean to rehearse</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:10:28,085 --> 00:10:30,046
<font color="white">before giving me the reward?</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:32,214
<font color="white">Late into the night</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:10:32,923 --> 00:10:34,634
<font color="white">would be even better.</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:10:34,717 --> 00:10:36,510
<font color="white">I look forward to it greatly.</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:10:45,978 --> 00:10:46,937
<font color="white">Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:11:15,716 --> 00:11:16,926
<font color="white">Here they are.</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:11:23,140 --> 00:11:24,517
<font color="white">You have copied the introduction</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:11:25,768 --> 00:11:27,395
<font color="white">most diligently.</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:11:30,272 --> 00:11:33,734
<font color="white">"A girl, upon reaching the age of 10,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">must refrain from venturing out."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

158
00:11:33,818 --> 00:11:36,278
<font color="white">"At 15, she must put her hair up."</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:11:36,362 --> 00:11:38,948
<font color="white">"And before 20, she must marry…"</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:11:39,824 --> 00:11:40,658
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:11:41,409 --> 00:11:42,868
<font color="white">She ought to come into bloom.</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:11:43,494 --> 00:11:45,413
<font color="white">Yes, indeed.</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:11:46,539 --> 00:11:47,915
<font color="white">Come now, take it.</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:11:47,998 --> 00:11:49,500
<font color="white">Take it. It's all right.</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:11:50,042 --> 00:11:50,960
<font color="white">You!</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:11:51,043 --> 00:11:53,379
<font color="white">The lady herself promised me a reply.</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:11:54,213 --> 00:11:55,381
<font color="white">Why are you meddling in this?</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:11:57,133 --> 00:11:58,884
<font color="white">It's all right. Just take it.</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:12:03,431 --> 00:12:04,265
<font color="white">Damn it.</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:12:28,998 --> 00:12:32,084
<font color="white"><i>A husband may take a second wife,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:12:32,168 --> 00:12:34,920
<font color="white"><i>yet nowhere is it written</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>that a wife can marry twice.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:12:35,004 --> 00:12:38,215
<font color="white"><i>Should a woman's conduct</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>defy the will of heaven and earth,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:12:39,216 --> 00:12:40,759
<font color="white"><i>she shall be punished by the heavens.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:12:43,345 --> 00:12:44,889
<font color="white"><i>I received your reply.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:12:45,764 --> 00:12:46,765
<font color="white"><i>Thanks to you,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:12:47,266 --> 00:12:50,394
<font color="white"><i>I learned what it is women study</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and commit to memory.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:12:50,895 --> 00:12:52,730
<font color="white"><i>It was most enlightening.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:12:54,398 --> 00:12:57,818
<font color="white"><i>Should a woman's conduct</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>defy the will of heaven and earth,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:12:57,902 --> 00:12:59,570
<font color="white"><i>she shall be punished by the heavens.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:13:00,529 --> 00:13:02,573
<font color="white"><i>Should she stray from</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>propriety and loyalty…</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:13:04,366 --> 00:13:06,952
<font color="white"><i>In the rear garden,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>I saw a pair of cuckoos.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:13:07,953 --> 00:13:10,998
<font color="white"><i>The male and female sat side by side,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>singing so affectionately together.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:13:12,249 --> 00:13:15,878
<font color="white"><i>As I stood there listening, spellbound,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to the love song of such humble creatures,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:13:16,795 --> 00:13:18,255
<font color="white"><i>I found myself envious.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:13:22,343 --> 00:13:25,596
<font color="white"><i>Should a woman's conduct</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>defy the will of heaven and earth,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:13:26,347 --> 00:13:28,015
<font color="white"><i>she shall be punished by the heavens.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:13:29,225 --> 00:13:31,352
<font color="white"><i>Should she stray from</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>propriety and loyalty,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:13:32,269 --> 00:13:34,647
<font color="white"><i>her husband shall cast her aside.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:14:13,852 --> 00:14:14,687
<font color="white">Eun-sil.</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:14:19,024 --> 00:14:21,610
<font color="white">Eun-sil, you are snoring rather loudly.</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:14:21,694 --> 00:14:22,736
<font color="white">Is that beef?</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:14:48,220 --> 00:14:51,765
<font color="white"><i>Yesterday, I took a stroll with In-ho,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and we spoke at length.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:14:52,516 --> 00:14:54,727
<font color="white"><i>I did not pry too deeply</i></font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:14:54,810 --> 00:14:57,354
<font color="white"><i>for fear of wounding</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>the young master's heart,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:14:57,938 --> 00:15:01,150
<font color="white"><i>yet it seemed he keenly feels</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>the absence left by his late brother.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:15:01,233 --> 00:15:02,067
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:15:03,277 --> 00:15:06,155
<font color="white"><i>Though I know it presumptuous of me,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:15:07,281 --> 00:15:11,118
<font color="white"><i>I found myself wishing I might fill</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>that empty place, however inadequately.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:15:14,079 --> 00:15:17,041
<font color="white"><i>Should a woman's conduct</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>defy the will of heaven and earth,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:15:17,124 --> 00:15:18,626
<font color="white"><i>she shall be punished by the heavens.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:15:19,418 --> 00:15:21,211
<font color="white"><i>Should she stray from</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>propriety and loyalty,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:15:21,921 --> 00:15:24,131
<font color="white"><i>her husband shall cast her aside.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:15:34,516 --> 00:15:35,351
<font color="white">Oh, dear.</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:15:36,852 --> 00:15:38,896
<font color="white">What did you say your name was again?</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:15:38,979 --> 00:15:41,273
<font color="white">What? You don't remember?</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:15:42,149 --> 00:15:44,526
<font color="white">Chil-seong. It's Chil-seong.</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:15:46,695 --> 00:15:47,863
<font color="white">That really hurts.</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:15:47,947 --> 00:15:48,906
<font color="white">Was it?</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:15:50,157 --> 00:15:52,952
<font color="white">For a servant's name,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yours is not so bad either.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

210
00:15:54,870 --> 00:15:55,871
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:15:57,039 --> 00:15:59,875
<font color="white">At birth, they called me Basket.</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:16:01,085 --> 00:16:03,170
<font color="white">Then Dog Balls.</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:16:03,253 --> 00:16:05,631
<font color="white">After that, Straw Mat.</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:16:05,714 --> 00:16:07,174
<font color="white">Because I was beaten in one so often.</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:16:12,346 --> 00:16:14,014
<font color="white">You find that amusing?</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:16:14,598 --> 00:16:17,351
<font color="white">Then who gave you the name Chil-seong?</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:16:18,102 --> 00:16:18,936
<font color="white">My master.</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:16:20,729 --> 00:16:21,605
<font color="white">Lord Cho Won.</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:16:23,107 --> 00:16:24,984
<font color="white">I had seven different masters,</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:16:25,067 --> 00:16:27,778
<font color="white">and each one had a different family name.</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:16:27,861 --> 00:16:29,571
<font color="white">Hence the name, Chil-seong. "Seven Names."</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:16:30,364 --> 00:16:33,367
<font color="white">He named me that and said the Cho family</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:16:34,243 --> 00:16:36,328
<font color="white">must be the last house I ever serve.</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:16:36,412 --> 00:16:39,289
<font color="white">Yours is a pitiful fate indeed.</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:16:40,499 --> 00:16:41,667
<font color="white">Wait, move.</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:16:43,419 --> 00:16:44,253
<font color="white">Oh, no.</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:16:46,213 --> 00:16:47,756
<font color="white">Oh, dear.</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:16:51,385 --> 00:16:54,471
<font color="white">For heaven's sake!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">You should have taken better care of it!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

229
00:16:59,977 --> 00:17:00,811
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:17:01,729 --> 00:17:02,771
<font color="white">Who is there?</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:17:02,855 --> 00:17:05,190
<font color="white">Who else would it be? It is Eun-sil.</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:17:05,983 --> 00:17:07,776
<font color="white">I have something for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:17:14,616 --> 00:17:16,076
<font color="white">Where on earth have you been?</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:17:33,385 --> 00:17:34,928
<font color="white">A letter came for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:17:37,473 --> 00:17:38,474
<font color="white">Letter?</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:17:40,768 --> 00:17:44,146
<font color="white"><i>Should a woman's conduct</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>defy the will of heaven and earth,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:17:44,813 --> 00:17:46,398
<font color="white"><i>she shall be punished by the heavens.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:17:47,441 --> 00:17:49,485
<font color="white"><i>Should she stray from</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>propriety and loyalty…</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:17:57,242 --> 00:17:59,787
<font color="white">Here, put this in and deliver it to her.</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:18:01,205 --> 00:18:02,039
<font color="white">Huh?</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:18:13,550 --> 00:18:14,676
<font color="white">All right.</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:16,845
<font color="white">I'll prepare a tonic</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of pomegranate and velvet antler.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

243
00:18:16,929 --> 00:18:19,098
<font color="white">Have her take it</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">before going to bed each night.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

244
00:18:20,766 --> 00:18:22,768
<font color="white">You must not miss a single day</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:18:23,393 --> 00:18:25,854
<font color="white">if you are to make your body fit</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for childbearing.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

246
00:18:27,898 --> 00:18:30,025
<font color="white">Thank you, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:18:32,653 --> 00:18:34,738
<font color="white">Thank my wife for it.</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:18:35,322 --> 00:18:36,532
<font color="white">Isn't that right, my lady?</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:19:00,514 --> 00:19:03,225
<font color="white"><i>A woman must keep her countenance proper,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>guard her chastity,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:19:04,268 --> 00:19:05,394
<font color="white"><i>and conduct herself…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:19:05,477 --> 00:19:08,272
<font color="white">She replied to a blank sheet?</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:11,817
<font color="white"><i>So she is not even reading them.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:19:11,900 --> 00:19:13,861
<font color="white">How lovely! My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:19:14,611 --> 00:19:15,696
<font color="white">How about this one?</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:19:20,075 --> 00:19:21,160
<font color="white">My letters.</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:19:23,620 --> 00:19:25,289
<font color="white">Do you even read them?</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:19:25,372 --> 00:19:27,416
<font color="white">Were you always so cruel?</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:19:29,209 --> 00:19:33,046
<font color="white">How can you send only a reply</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">without even trying to look into my heart?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

259
00:19:33,130 --> 00:19:34,089
<font color="white">You, sir…</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:19:36,216 --> 00:19:39,386
<font color="white">have disregarded</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">every earnest plea I made.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

261
00:19:40,262 --> 00:19:43,557
<font color="white">I, on the other hand,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">have kept every promise I made to you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

262
00:19:49,104 --> 00:19:51,231
<font color="white">Have you no pity for my heart, woman?</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:20:18,300 --> 00:20:19,509
<font color="white">Tie it up tight.</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:20:20,052 --> 00:20:22,221
<font color="white">Just take that one with you.</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:20:42,699 --> 00:20:43,659
<font color="white">Here we go.</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:21:00,759 --> 00:21:01,593
<font color="white">Mother.</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:21:02,302 --> 00:21:04,805
<font color="white">I shall soon follow you,</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:21:06,682 --> 00:21:07,933
<font color="white">my dear husband.</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:21:08,517 --> 00:21:09,851
<font color="white">Easy now.</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:21:11,270 --> 00:21:14,940
<font color="white">I did not know your masters had gone</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to hold the rite ending their mourning.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

271
00:21:15,023 --> 00:21:16,191
<font color="white">Dear me.</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:21:16,275 --> 00:21:19,027
<font color="white">We were given all this fine liquor.</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:21:21,238 --> 00:21:23,532
<font color="white">-My, what a waste.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-What is that? Liquor?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

274
00:21:27,995 --> 00:21:29,746
<font color="white">-Hey! Wait!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Hey!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

275
00:21:29,830 --> 00:21:31,415
<font color="white">What are you doing, you fool?</font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:21:31,498 --> 00:21:33,417
<font color="white">Chil-seong,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I thought you were better than this!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

277
00:21:33,500 --> 00:21:35,168
<font color="white">Well, what else can I do?</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:21:35,252 --> 00:21:37,754
<font color="white">I cannot defy my master's orders, can I?.</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:21:38,380 --> 00:21:41,425
<font color="white">Listen, all of you!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">This soil shall be as rich as can be.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

280
00:21:41,508 --> 00:21:43,677
<font color="white">You ought to plant</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">something here next year.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

281
00:21:43,760 --> 00:21:45,137
<font color="white">-Good heavens!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Wait!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

282
00:21:45,220 --> 00:21:47,139
<font color="white">Why would he throw such fine liquor away?</font><font color="white"></font>

283
00:21:47,222 --> 00:21:50,183
<font color="white">Just keep pouring it out,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">just as your master ordered!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

284
00:21:50,267 --> 00:21:52,686
<font color="white">-Go on.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Pour it in here.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

285
00:21:52,769 --> 00:21:54,771
<font color="white">You are not disobeying a thing!</font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:21:54,855 --> 00:21:57,607
<font color="white">-Come now.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Go on!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

287
00:21:57,691 --> 00:22:00,319
<font color="white">-We have some ritual food left, don't we?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

288
00:22:00,986 --> 00:22:04,531
<font color="white">Chil-seong, you rascal!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">You are one fine servant!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

289
00:23:31,159 --> 00:23:34,579
<font color="white">I HAVE READ IT</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:23:38,834 --> 00:23:42,462
<font color="white">Chil-seong, you rascal!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">You are one fine servant!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

291
00:23:51,888 --> 00:23:52,931
<font color="white">Let's see.</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:24:09,406 --> 00:24:11,324
<font color="white">I have this face,</font><font color="white"></font>

293
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:14,411
<font color="white">and I even paired it with sweetness.</font><font color="white"></font>

294
00:24:17,706 --> 00:24:20,458
<font color="white">What more am I meant to do? Darn it.</font><font color="white"></font>

295
00:24:42,230 --> 00:24:43,648
<font color="white"><i>I received your reply.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:24:44,274 --> 00:24:46,443
<font color="white"><i>-Your handwriting is as beautiful…</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>-You're a fool.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:24:46,526 --> 00:24:48,195
<font color="white"><i>How could you still continue to write</i></font><font color="white"></font>

298
00:24:48,278 --> 00:24:49,905
<font color="white"><i>after receiving such an absurd reply?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

299
00:24:49,988 --> 00:24:51,948
<font color="white"><i>Why do you torment me so?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

300
00:25:01,333 --> 00:25:04,085
<font color="white"><i>Yesterday, I took a stroll with In-ho,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and we spoke at length.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

301
00:25:04,169 --> 00:25:06,087
<font color="white"><i>I knew I was right about you.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:25:06,588 --> 00:25:08,882
<font color="white"><i>Deep within your heart</i></font><font color="white"></font>

303
00:25:08,965 --> 00:25:11,301
<font color="white"><i>lies such gentle kindness.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:25:12,469 --> 00:25:14,554
<font color="white"><i>But hearing you say</i></font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:25:14,638 --> 00:25:18,475
<font color="white"><i>you wished to fill that empty place</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>for my brother-in-law,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:25:18,558 --> 00:25:20,393
<font color="white"><i>I find myself envious of him.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:25:21,603 --> 00:25:24,022
<font color="white"><i>It is terribly wrong of me</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to feel this way, is it not?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

308
00:25:33,448 --> 00:25:34,699
<font color="white"><i>My lord, whom I long for,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

309
00:25:35,700 --> 00:25:37,827
<font color="white"><i>please appear before me.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

310
00:25:39,579 --> 00:25:40,997
<font color="white"><i>My heart is in such turmoil</i></font><font color="white"></font>

311
00:25:41,539 --> 00:25:43,416
<font color="white"><i>that I cannot sleep at all.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:25:45,210 --> 00:25:47,170
<font color="white"><i>Please appear to me at least in my dreams.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:25:47,879 --> 00:25:51,174
<font color="white">MY LORD, WHOM I LONG FOR,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">PLEASE APPEAR BEFORE ME</font><font color="white"></font></font>

314
00:26:07,774 --> 00:26:11,486
<font color="white">I HAVE READ IT</font><font color="white"></font>

315
00:26:14,572 --> 00:26:16,116
<font color="white">Eun-sil, are you there?</font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:26:25,417 --> 00:26:26,293
<font color="white">Eun-sil.</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:26:32,507 --> 00:26:34,968
<font color="white">Do not be alarmed, my lady.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">It is I, Cho Won.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

318
00:26:38,555 --> 00:26:39,889
<font color="white">I have come</font><font color="white"></font>

319
00:26:40,765 --> 00:26:41,808
<font color="white">to see you.</font><font color="white"></font>

320
00:26:41,891 --> 00:26:44,019
<font color="white">What scandalous words are these?</font><font color="white"></font>

321
00:26:44,519 --> 00:26:46,396
<font color="white">Please return at once,</font><font color="white"></font>

322
00:26:46,479 --> 00:26:48,940
<font color="white">and I shall pretend</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">none of this happened tonight.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

323
00:26:49,691 --> 00:26:50,525
<font color="white">Do you mean to say</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:26:51,693 --> 00:26:53,695
<font color="white">you did not wish to see me?</font><font color="white"></font>

325
00:26:54,487 --> 00:26:57,032
<font color="white">How could a gentleman learned in propriety</font><font color="white"></font>

326
00:26:58,325 --> 00:27:00,744
<font color="white">ask such an insulting question?</font><font color="white"></font>

327
00:27:02,537 --> 00:27:03,621
<font color="white">Are my feelings…</font><font color="white"></font>

328
00:27:07,083 --> 00:27:09,252
<font color="white">truly an insult to you?</font><font color="white"></font>

329
00:27:17,927 --> 00:27:20,764
<font color="white">Knowing now that our hearts feel the same…</font><font color="white"></font>

330
00:27:23,391 --> 00:27:25,018
<font color="white">how could I…</font><font color="white"></font>

331
00:27:25,518 --> 00:27:27,687
<font color="white">How could I keep myself from coming here?</font><font color="white"></font>

332
00:27:29,439 --> 00:27:30,315
<font color="white">That is why</font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:34,444
<font color="white">you answered</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">my letters as well, is it not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

334
00:27:36,613 --> 00:27:37,447
<font color="white">I have</font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:27:38,740 --> 00:27:40,950
<font color="white">read your replies.</font><font color="white"></font>

336
00:27:43,286 --> 00:27:45,372
<font color="white">My lord, please do not do this.</font><font color="white"></font>

337
00:27:49,250 --> 00:27:51,628
<font color="white">Why must you be so cruel to me?</font><font color="white"></font>

338
00:27:52,712 --> 00:27:56,299
<font color="white">This is a bond</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that can never be fulfilled in this life.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

339
00:27:58,385 --> 00:27:59,928
<font color="white">Why do you keep longing for it?</font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:28:10,438 --> 00:28:11,523
<font color="white">Then in the next life…</font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:28:13,983 --> 00:28:16,069
<font color="white">will I be allowed to reach you?</font><font color="white"></font>

342
00:28:20,740 --> 00:28:21,866
<font color="white">If so, then…</font><font color="white"></font>

343
00:28:25,578 --> 00:28:27,163
<font color="white">send me there at once.</font><font color="white"></font>

344
00:28:31,835 --> 00:28:32,919
<font color="white">Otherwise…</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:28:41,469 --> 00:28:43,221
<font color="white">I shall reach you…</font><font color="white"></font>

346
00:28:46,891 --> 00:28:48,768
<font color="white">in this life instead.</font><font color="white"></font>

347
00:28:52,313 --> 00:28:53,523
<font color="white">Just as I am now.</font><font color="white"></font>

348
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:13,209
<font color="white">Tonight…</font><font color="white"></font>

349
00:29:19,674 --> 00:29:21,384
<font color="white">we shall meet in our dreams.</font><font color="white"></font>

350
00:29:24,262 --> 00:29:25,096
<font color="white">We must.</font><font color="white"></font>

351
00:29:52,624 --> 00:29:55,543
<font color="white">She falls so easily,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">it is almost disappointing.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

352
00:29:59,547 --> 00:30:01,758
<font color="white">I wonder if she will</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">cry herself to sleep tonight.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

353
00:30:21,653 --> 00:30:22,695
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

354
00:30:22,779 --> 00:30:25,073
<font color="white">Lord Cho Won is here to see you.</font><font color="white"></font>

355
00:30:37,001 --> 00:30:39,128
<font color="white">You told me to come</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">once I felt I was close.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

356
00:30:40,630 --> 00:30:42,632
<font color="white">So though I knew how late it was…</font><font color="white"></font>

357
00:30:44,717 --> 00:30:46,845
<font color="white">I came nonetheless. Forgive me.</font><font color="white"></font>

358
00:30:46,928 --> 00:30:48,680
<font color="white">You must be quite certain of yourself.</font><font color="white"></font>

359
00:30:51,474 --> 00:30:54,811
<font color="white">I was just with the widow.</font><font color="white"></font>

360
00:30:56,020 --> 00:30:57,272
<font color="white">Just the two of us.</font><font color="white"></font>

361
00:30:58,022 --> 00:31:00,692
<font color="white">Very… privately.</font><font color="white"></font>

362
00:31:02,235 --> 00:31:03,903
<font color="white">How remarkable you are.</font><font color="white"></font>

363
00:31:04,696 --> 00:31:07,407
<font color="white">There must have been</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at least ten pairs of eyes watching.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

364
00:31:10,285 --> 00:31:11,619
<font color="white">What is there for me to fear</font><font color="white"></font>

365
00:31:12,662 --> 00:31:14,789
<font color="white">when I have set my mind on something?</font><font color="white"></font>

366
00:31:15,373 --> 00:31:18,084
<font color="white">That woman</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who once seemed all edge and steel</font><font color="white"></font></font>

367
00:31:18,668 --> 00:31:21,337
<font color="white">now rests so sweetly in my arms.</font><font color="white"></font>

368
00:31:23,006 --> 00:31:24,090
<font color="white">In your arms?</font><font color="white"></font>

369
00:31:25,550 --> 00:31:26,467
<font color="white">The widow?</font><font color="white"></font>

370
00:31:26,968 --> 00:31:29,971
<font color="white">It was the embrace of a man</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">she had never known before.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

371
00:31:30,555 --> 00:31:31,848
<font color="white">She melted right into me.</font><font color="white"></font>

372
00:31:36,144 --> 00:31:37,228
<font color="white">I almost smiled</font><font color="white"></font>

373
00:31:37,937 --> 00:31:39,731
<font color="white">without meaning to.</font><font color="white"></font>

374
00:31:41,858 --> 00:31:42,775
<font color="white">Until now,</font><font color="white"></font>

375
00:31:44,110 --> 00:31:46,237
<font color="white">I had moved only as planned.</font><font color="white"></font>

376
00:31:48,031 --> 00:31:48,948
<font color="white">But I nearly…</font><font color="white"></font>

377
00:31:52,285 --> 00:31:53,494
<font color="white">gave myself away.</font><font color="white"></font>

378
00:31:58,166 --> 00:31:59,208
<font color="white">Gave yourself away?</font><font color="white"></font>

379
00:32:00,376 --> 00:32:01,294
<font color="white">What do you mean?</font><font color="white"></font>

380
00:32:01,377 --> 00:32:02,545
<font color="white">What do you think?</font><font color="white"></font>

381
00:32:09,844 --> 00:32:12,221
<font color="white">My dazzling little performance. What else?</font><font color="white"></font>

382
00:32:14,015 --> 00:32:15,141
<font color="white">Now I am curious</font><font color="white"></font>

383
00:32:16,100 --> 00:32:18,394
<font color="white">what exactly you did to her.</font><font color="white"></font>

384
00:32:22,607 --> 00:32:25,026
<font color="white">"If only I could reach you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in the next life,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

385
00:32:26,653 --> 00:32:27,946
<font color="white">I would go there…</font><font color="white"></font>

386
00:32:30,156 --> 00:32:33,201
<font color="white">this very moment."</font><font color="white"></font>

387
00:32:33,993 --> 00:32:36,663
<font color="white">At last, I have met a man</font><font color="white"></font>

388
00:32:37,747 --> 00:32:39,707
<font color="white">who leaves me breathless.</font><font color="white"></font>

389
00:32:49,717 --> 00:32:51,678
<font color="white">I longed so dearly</font><font color="white"></font>

390
00:32:52,845 --> 00:32:54,722
<font color="white">for your great hands.</font><font color="white"></font>

391
00:33:00,561 --> 00:33:01,479
<font color="white">And I too…</font><font color="white"></font>

392
00:33:04,440 --> 00:33:05,733
<font color="white">longed day and night…</font><font color="white"></font>

393
00:33:08,194 --> 00:33:10,697
<font color="white">for your breath upon me.</font><font color="white"></font>

394
00:33:14,325 --> 00:33:15,827
<font color="white">Hearing such words,</font><font color="white"></font>

395
00:33:16,452 --> 00:33:19,539
<font color="white">I feel I shall spend the night</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">thoroughly drenched.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

396
00:33:53,906 --> 00:33:56,534
<font color="white">"My thighs seem to part</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of their own accord,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

397
00:33:57,035 --> 00:33:59,078
<font color="white">yet there is no husband</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to pound between them."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

398
00:33:59,620 --> 00:34:03,249
<font color="white"><i>I long so dearly for your great hands.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

399
00:34:03,332 --> 00:34:04,834
<font color="white">"Come visit me once."</font><font color="white"></font>

400
00:34:05,960 --> 00:34:08,796
<font color="white">"And scold</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">this drenched little thing of mine."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

401
00:34:11,674 --> 00:34:12,884
<font color="white">BUN-HUI</font><font color="white"></font>

402
00:34:12,967 --> 00:34:14,510
<font color="white">"Bun-hui"?</font><font color="white"></font>

403
00:34:27,482 --> 00:34:28,399
<font color="white">You see?</font><font color="white"></font>

404
00:34:30,151 --> 00:34:33,279
<font color="white">You ought not have left</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">after merely brushing her shoulder.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

405
00:34:37,158 --> 00:34:39,035
<font color="white">It came from the Tobacco Shop.</font><font color="white"></font>

406
00:34:39,786 --> 00:34:41,496
<font color="white">From So-ok's mother.</font><font color="white"></font>

407
00:34:45,792 --> 00:34:48,044
<font color="white">There are women all across the land</font><font color="white"></font>

408
00:34:49,045 --> 00:34:51,339
<font color="white">who still pine for me.</font><font color="white"></font>

409
00:34:51,422 --> 00:34:53,883
<font color="white">She is simply one among them.</font><font color="white"></font>

410
00:34:53,966 --> 00:34:55,635
<font color="white">You see,</font><font color="white"></font>

411
00:34:56,803 --> 00:35:01,307
<font color="white">women are exceedingly displeased</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">by talk of other women.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

412
00:35:02,058 --> 00:35:03,017
<font color="white">So,</font><font color="white"></font>

413
00:35:04,268 --> 00:35:06,187
<font color="white">did it trouble you so?</font><font color="white"></font>

414
00:35:07,772 --> 00:35:08,606
<font color="white">Look at you.</font><font color="white"></font>

415
00:35:10,691 --> 00:35:11,567
<font color="white">There is still</font><font color="white"></font>

416
00:35:12,902 --> 00:35:14,654
<font color="white">bitterness lingering between your brows.</font><font color="white"></font>

417
00:35:16,489 --> 00:35:19,033
<font color="white">It's a pity I cannot imitate it for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

418
00:35:24,288 --> 00:35:26,207
<font color="white">As an apology,</font><font color="white"></font>

419
00:35:27,875 --> 00:35:28,835
<font color="white">I shall</font><font color="white"></font>

420
00:35:30,378 --> 00:35:31,587
<font color="white">give you this letter.</font><font color="white"></font>

421
00:35:32,255 --> 00:35:35,466
<font color="white">I suspect it shall prove more useful</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in your hands than mine.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

422
00:35:38,678 --> 00:35:41,639
<font color="white">The daughter of the woman who wrote it.</font><font color="white"></font>

423
00:35:42,223 --> 00:35:43,266
<font color="white">Teach her with this.</font><font color="white"></font>

424
00:35:44,183 --> 00:35:46,561
<font color="white">Nothing could better prepare her</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to be a fine concubine.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

425
00:35:47,145 --> 00:35:49,856
<font color="white">Just have her recite these words,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and your husband</font><font color="white"></font></font>

426
00:35:51,357 --> 00:35:52,775
<font color="white">shall be greatly satisfied.</font><font color="white"></font>

427
00:35:57,488 --> 00:35:58,573
<font color="white">Very well.</font><font color="white"></font>

428
00:35:59,907 --> 00:36:01,659
<font color="white">I shall put it to good use.</font><font color="white"></font>

429
00:36:02,660 --> 00:36:03,744
<font color="white">I believe</font><font color="white"></font>

430
00:36:04,829 --> 00:36:07,206
<font color="white">there may be someone</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who needs it more than So-ok.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

431
00:36:09,667 --> 00:36:11,919
<font color="white">What if I gave it to that widow?</font><font color="white"></font>

432
00:36:15,047 --> 00:36:15,923
<font color="white">Well,</font><font color="white"></font>

433
00:36:16,465 --> 00:36:20,344
<font color="white">it belongs to me now,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so I need not ask you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

434
00:36:26,392 --> 00:36:27,310
<font color="white">Oh, dear.</font><font color="white"></font>

435
00:36:29,228 --> 00:36:32,565
<font color="white">You swallowed rather hard just now.</font><font color="white"></font>

436
00:36:32,648 --> 00:36:36,152
<font color="white">You must be quite flustered.</font><font color="white"></font>

437
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:41,199
<font color="white">It's a pity I cannot imitate it for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

438
00:36:43,242 --> 00:36:44,243
<font color="white">Certainly not.</font><font color="white"></font>

439
00:36:45,661 --> 00:36:46,495
<font color="white">I was merely</font><font color="white"></font>

440
00:36:47,997 --> 00:36:49,832
<font color="white">imagining how overwhelmed she would be</font><font color="white"></font>

441
00:36:49,916 --> 00:36:52,501
<font color="white">by my manly charms</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">upon reading that letter.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

442
00:36:55,588 --> 00:36:58,716
<font color="white">I only hope she does not faint outright.</font><font color="white"></font>

443
00:37:03,763 --> 00:37:04,764
<font color="white">Gye-hwa,</font><font color="white"></font>

444
00:37:05,640 --> 00:37:06,933
<font color="white">are you there?</font><font color="white"></font>

445
00:37:07,642 --> 00:37:09,143
<font color="white">You called for me, madam?</font><font color="white"></font>

446
00:37:09,977 --> 00:37:11,771
<font color="white">Take this letter at once</font><font color="white"></font>

447
00:37:11,854 --> 00:37:13,856
<font color="white">to the Left State Councilor's</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">daughter-in-law.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

448
00:37:17,318 --> 00:37:18,277
<font color="white">Gye-hwa.</font><font color="white"></font>

449
00:37:19,153 --> 00:37:20,446
<font color="white">Did you not hear me?</font><font color="white"></font>

450
00:37:20,529 --> 00:37:21,447
<font color="white">I did, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

451
00:37:22,031 --> 00:37:24,283
<font color="white">I shall come in then.</font><font color="white"></font>

452
00:37:44,804 --> 00:37:46,597
<font color="white">I am rather curious</font><font color="white"></font>

453
00:37:47,139 --> 00:37:49,850
<font color="white">how that widow shall respond</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">after reading those words.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

454
00:37:57,858 --> 00:37:59,568
<font color="white">If you want me to call it off,</font><font color="white"></font>

455
00:38:00,611 --> 00:38:03,781
<font color="white">I shall stop the letter</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">before it reaches her.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

456
00:38:04,782 --> 00:38:05,950
<font color="white">Just say the word.</font><font color="white"></font>

457
00:38:06,617 --> 00:38:07,660
<font color="white">What shall I do?</font><font color="white"></font>

458
00:38:12,832 --> 00:38:13,666
<font color="white">Well?</font><font color="white"></font>

459
00:38:18,296 --> 00:38:20,673
<font color="white">By all means, see it through to the end.</font><font color="white"></font>

460
00:38:53,497 --> 00:38:54,540
<font color="white">Where is…</font><font color="white"></font>

461
00:38:55,249 --> 00:38:56,083
<font color="white">Here it is.</font><font color="white"></font>

462
00:39:00,212 --> 00:39:04,675
<font color="white">KWON GEUM-HO</font><font color="white"></font>

463
00:39:40,503 --> 00:39:41,337
<font color="white">You there.</font><font color="white"></font>

464
00:39:46,759 --> 00:39:48,469
<font color="white">Are you not Gye-hwa?</font><font color="white"></font>

465
00:39:49,512 --> 00:39:50,846
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

466
00:39:58,479 --> 00:39:59,438
<font color="white">Come along now.</font><font color="white"></font>

467
00:40:06,862 --> 00:40:09,782
<font color="white">So she sent you out in the dead of night</font><font color="white"></font>

468
00:40:10,533 --> 00:40:12,785
<font color="white">merely to return Geum-ho's belongings?</font><font color="white"></font>

469
00:40:13,828 --> 00:40:14,787
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

470
00:40:15,287 --> 00:40:18,999
<font color="white">She said it was far too precious to delay</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">once it had been found.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

471
00:40:21,085 --> 00:40:22,128
<font color="white">I see.</font><font color="white"></font>

472
00:40:23,170 --> 00:40:24,046
<font color="white">Mrs. Gang-hwa,</font><font color="white"></font>

473
00:40:24,130 --> 00:40:27,091
<font color="white">hold onto it</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and give it to Hui-yeon in the morning.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

474
00:40:27,174 --> 00:40:28,217
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

475
00:40:37,643 --> 00:40:39,019
<font color="white">Is that a tobacco box?</font><font color="white"></font>

476
00:40:40,438 --> 00:40:41,272
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

477
00:40:44,275 --> 00:40:45,776
<font color="white">How thoughtful of her.</font><font color="white"></font>

478
00:40:46,444 --> 00:40:48,612
<font color="white">She still remembered</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to send something for me as well.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

479
00:40:49,655 --> 00:40:50,948
<font color="white">Bring it inside.</font><font color="white"></font>

480
00:40:51,657 --> 00:40:52,491
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

481
00:40:53,367 --> 00:40:54,910
<font color="white">You may go now.</font><font color="white"></font>

482
00:40:56,036 --> 00:40:56,871
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

483
00:41:35,326 --> 00:41:36,160
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

484
00:41:36,785 --> 00:41:38,162
<font color="white">It is Gye-hwa.</font><font color="white"></font>

485
00:41:38,245 --> 00:41:39,413
<font color="white">Pardon the intrusion.</font><font color="white"></font>

486
00:41:50,132 --> 00:41:51,509
<font color="white">My apologies, madam!</font><font color="white"></font>

487
00:41:52,092 --> 00:41:53,260
<font color="white">The Lady of the First Rank</font><font color="white"></font>

488
00:41:53,928 --> 00:41:56,430
<font color="white">took the tobacco box with her.</font><font color="white"></font>

489
00:42:00,309 --> 00:42:02,353
<font color="white">And the letter inside it as well?</font><font color="white"></font>

490
00:42:02,436 --> 00:42:03,270
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

491
00:42:03,854 --> 00:42:06,190
<font color="white">The fault is mine.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I do not deserve to be forgiven.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

492
00:42:06,273 --> 00:42:08,692
<font color="white">I shall accept</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">whatever punishment you give.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

493
00:42:10,945 --> 00:42:11,820
<font color="white">Gye-hwa.</font><font color="white"></font>

494
00:42:12,780 --> 00:42:13,614
<font color="white">Yes, madam?</font><font color="white"></font>

495
00:42:15,783 --> 00:42:18,452
<font color="white">Have I ever punished you?</font><font color="white"></font>

496
00:42:33,509 --> 00:42:35,302
<font color="white">Prepare a proper gift</font><font color="white"></font>

497
00:42:36,387 --> 00:42:37,930
<font color="white">for Her Ladyship at once.</font><font color="white"></font>

498
00:46:39,922 --> 00:46:44,927
<font color="white">Subtitle translation by: Yoonjung Song</font><font color="white"></font>

